{# Left panel (prototype `.ed-left`): underline tabs "Vrstvy n" / "Kontejnery n"
   over the layers list and the containers list. The compose actions (Pozadí,
   text, image, shape, checklist) live in the tool row above the stage —
   editor/_editor_tools.html.twig. Shared by both editors.

   Tabs are two radios + CSS (`:has()` in editor.css) — no JS, so they can't
   fight the Stimulus targets inside. The counts are written by the
   controllers that build the rows (CSS counters over dynamic rows stayed 0
   in some browsers). The radios carry `form="ed-no-form"` so they never
   join the editor form's POST. #}
{# Sticky only below lg — in the app-shell layout the surrounding column is the
   scroll container, where a sticky card would offset itself as you scroll it. #}
<div class="card editor-left-panel-card ed-left">
    <input type="radio" class="ed-ltab-input" name="ed-left-tab" id="ed-tab-layers" form="ed-no-form" checked>
    <input type="radio" class="ed-ltab-input" name="ed-left-tab" id="ed-tab-containers" form="ed-no-form">

    {# Photoshop-style layers list (canvas_layers_controller): topmost first,
       hover highlights the object on the stage, click selects it and opens
       its property popover, drag restacks. Rows are built by JS from the live
       Fabric object list. #}
    <div class="ed-lpane ed-lpane--layers">
        <div class="canvas-layers-list" data-canvas-layers-target="list" role="list" aria-label="Vrstvy plátna"></div>
    </div>

    {# Containers panel (canvas_container_controller): tree-ordered rows in the
       zones' depth colours, hover highlights the zone on the stage, click
       selects the container. The controller hides `panel` while no
       containers exist — the hint below then explains the feature. #}
    <div class="ed-lpane ed-lpane--containers">
        <div class="d-none" data-canvas-container-target="panel">
            <div class="container-panel-list" data-canvas-container-target="panelList" role="list" aria-label="Kontejnery plátna"></div>
        </div>
        <p class="ed-hint">Kontejner řadí texty pod sebe s pevnou mezerou. Když klient vyplní méně řádků, ostatní se posunou. Vytvoříte ho z několika vybraných prvků (ikona v liště nad výběrem).</p>
    </div>

    <div class="ed-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Panel editoru">
        <label for="ed-tab-layers" role="tab">Vrstvy <span class="pd-n ed-count" aria-hidden="true" data-canvas-layers-target="count">0</span></label>
        <label for="ed-tab-containers" role="tab">Kontejnery <span class="pd-n ed-count" aria-hidden="true" data-canvas-container-target="panelCount">0</span></label>
    </div>

    {% if group_mode|default(false) %}
        <p class="ed-hint ed-hint--group">{{ icon('refresh', 's12') }} Přidání a smazání prvku se přenáší do všech formátů vždy. Posuny, velikosti a vlastnosti jen když je zapnuté <strong>Upravovat všechny formáty najednou</strong> — pak poměrově podle rozměru, texty a vlastnosti přesně.</p>
    {% endif %}
</div>
